{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54004","headline":"十二时歌 九 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日入酉，除却荒凉更何守。\n云水高流定委无，历寺沙弥镇常有。\n出格言，不到口，枉续牟尼子孙後。\n一条拄杖麤楋蔾，不但登山兼打狗。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}